  "title": "Consumer AI Chatbots Keep Climbing in March — and Claude Is the Story to Watch",
  "summary": "March 2026 was another strong month for consumer AI Chatbot usage, with total unique desktop visitors in the U.S. rising to 44.4 million, up 21.3% from February. The category is no longer growing on hype alone; it is expanding because users are beginning to embed AI chatbots into daily work, search, writing, coding, and decision-making. The latest rankings show that while OpenAI still dominates on scale, the market as a whole is becoming more competitive as Google, Microsoft, and Anthropic each posted meaningful month-over-month growth.",
